<div class="wrap bz">
<section class="hero" style="padding:46px 0 6px">
  <div class="kicker"><span data-gloss="en"><span class="s-trad">瀏覽 · Browse</span><span class="s-simp">浏览 · Browse</span></span><span data-gloss="vi"><span class="s-trad">瀏覽 · Duyệt</span><span class="s-simp">浏览 · Duyệt</span></span></div>
  <h1 class="vh"><span data-gloss="en">Browse by level, kind, and family.</span><span data-gloss="vi">Duyệt theo cấp, loại và họ chữ.</span></h1>
  <p class="sub"><span data-gloss="en">Looking up a known word is faster by search. Browse is for orientation: pick a level and a kind, then open a focused set.</span><span data-gloss="vi">Tra một từ đã biết thì tìm kiếm nhanh hơn. Duyệt là để định hướng: chọn một cấp và một loại, rồi mở một nhóm mục đã được khoanh vùng.</span></p>
  <div class="bigsearch">
  <div class="sbox">
    <input id="q" data-rel="" placeholder="查 — search Chinese, pinyin, or English…" data-placeholder-en="查 — search Chinese, pinyin, or English…" data-placeholder-vi="查 · tìm chữ Hán, pinyin, hoặc tiếng Việt…" autocomplete="off" />
    <button id="qgo"><span data-gloss="en">查 Look up</span><span data-gloss="vi">查 Tra</span></button>
  </div>
  <div class="sfacet-bar">
    <button type="button" class="sfacet-kind" data-facet="component"><span data-gloss="en">component</span><span data-gloss="vi">thành phần</span></button>
    <button type="button" class="sfacet-kind" data-facet="phonetic"><span data-gloss="en">phonetic</span><span data-gloss="vi">thành phần âm</span></button>
    <button type="button" class="sfacet-kind" data-facet="band"><span data-gloss="en">band</span><span data-gloss="vi">cấp</span></button>
  </div>
  <div class="sfacets" id="sfacets"></div>
  <div class="sresults" id="sresults"></div>
</div>
</section>
<style>
.bz .maplab{margin:38px 0 14px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px}
.bz .maplab .h{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;font-weight:650}
.bz .maplab .n{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint)}
.bz .map{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.bz .kc{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--rule);padding:18px 18px 8px;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden}
.bz .kc-h{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);padding:0 6px 12px;margin-bottom:6px}
.bz .kc-h .g{font-family:var(--kai);font-size:22px}
.bz .kc-h .t{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:13px;font-weight:650}
.bz .kc-h .c{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--seal)}
.bz .lr{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:8px 6px;border-bottom:1px dotted var(--rule);font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12.5px;text-decoration:none;color:inherit}
.bz a.lr:hover .lv{color:var(--seal)}
.bz .lr:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.bz .lr .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;flex:none;background:var(--rule2)}
.bz .lr .dot.on{background:var(--seal)}
.bz .lr .lv{color:var(--ink)}
.bz .lr .ct{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--mut)}
.bz .lr .ct.loom{color:var(--faint)}
.bz .bnote{margin:28px 0 0;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12px;color:var(--faint);line-height:1.7}
@media(max-width:760px){.bz .map{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
<div class="maplab"><span class="h"><span data-gloss="en">The map</span><span data-gloss="vi">Bản đồ</span></span><span class="n"><span data-gloss="en">level × kind · counts read from the build</span><span data-gloss="vi">cấp × loại · số liệu lấy từ bản dựng</span></span></div>
<div class="map">
  <div class="kc"><div class="kc-h"><span class="g">字</span><span class="t"><span data-gloss="en">Characters</span><span data-gloss="vi">Chữ</span></span><span class="c">2662</span></div><a class="lr" href="browse-c-a1"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 1</span><span class="ct">549</span></a><a class="lr" href="browse-c-a2"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 2</span><span class="ct">599</span></a><a class="lr" href="browse-c-b1"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 3</span><span class="ct">598</span></a><a class="lr" href="browse-c-b2"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 4</span><span class="ct">467</span></a><a class="lr" href="browse-c-c1"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 5</span><span class="ct">399</span></a><a class="lr" href="browse-c-c2"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 6</span><span class="ct">48</span></a></div>
  <div class="kc"><div class="kc-h"><span class="g"><span class="s-trad">詞</span><span class="s-simp">词</span></span><span class="t"><span data-gloss="en">Words</span><span data-gloss="vi">Từ</span></span><span class="c">7001</span></div><a class="lr" href="browse-w-a1"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 1</span><span class="ct">435</span></a><a class="lr" href="browse-w-a2"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 2</span><span class="ct">472</span></a><a class="lr" href="browse-w-b1"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 3</span><span class="ct">782</span></a><a class="lr" href="browse-w-b2"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 4</span><span class="ct">1841</span></a><a class="lr" href="browse-w-c1"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 5</span><span class="ct">2817</span></a><a class="lr" href="browse-w-c2"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TOCFL 6</span><span class="ct">529</span></a></div>
  <div class="kc"><div class="kc-h"><span class="g"><span class="s-trad">語法</span><span class="s-simp">语法</span></span><span class="t"><span data-gloss="en">Grammar</span><span data-gloss="vi">Ngữ pháp</span></span><span class="c">515</span></div><a class="lr" href="grammar"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TBCL 1</span><span class="ct">18</span></a><a class="lr" href="grammar"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TBCL 2</span><span class="ct">95</span></a><a class="lr" href="grammar"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TBCL 3</span><span class="ct">142</span></a><a class="lr" href="grammar"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TBCL 4</span><span class="ct">154</span></a><a class="lr" href="grammar"><span class="dot on"></span><span class="lv">TBCL 5</span><span class="ct">106</span></a></div>
</div>
<p class="bnote"><span data-gloss="en">Each cell opens that level and kind on its own page rather than the whole corpus at once. Grammar is browsed by what you want to say, on its own page.</span><span data-gloss="vi">Mỗi ô mở cấp và loại đó trên một trang riêng, thay vì cả kho cùng lúc. Ngữ pháp thì duyệt theo điều bạn muốn nói, ở trang riêng của nó.</span></p>
</div>
